    {
      "text": "On the immortal zombie body occupied by his first split soul, Fang Yuan tosses out two lifespan Gu under Strength Reversing Life and Death so that body will not die at once; long bathing in the light of wisdom in Imperial Court blessed land had nearly ended its lifespan. The clone uses the Gu at once, leaves the sovereign immortal aperture into a chosen empty site in Northern Plains, and passes immortal ascension as a time path Gu Immortal.",
